{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":20017981,"chapterID":15000306,"chapterNumber":"III-6","sectionNumber":"36-661","title":"Size of required berths","officialText":"","previewText":"C1 C2 C3 C4 C5 C6 C7 C8\n\nIn all districts, as indicated, all required accessory off- street loading berths, open or enclosed, shall conform to the regulations on minimum dimensions set forth in the following table. The dimensions of off-street berths shall not include driveways or entrances to or exits from such off-street berths. Loading requirement categories (LRC) shall be as set forth in Section 36-62 (Required A","blocks":[{"id":"zr-17981-block-001","kind":"html","html":"<p>C1 C2 C3 C4 C5 C6 C7 C8</p>","plainText":"C1 C2 C3 C4 C5 C6 C7 C8"},{"id":"zr-17981-block-002","kind":"html","html":"<p>In all districts, as indicated, all required <strong><em>accessory</em></strong> off- street loading berths, open or enclosed, shall conform to the regulations on minimum dimensions set forth in the following table. The dimensions of off-street berths shall not include driveways or entrances to or exits from such off-street berths. Loading requirement categories (LRC) shall be as set forth in Section <a class=\"sec-link-inline\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iii/chapter-6#36-62\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-iii/chapter-6#36-62\"><span>36-62</span></a> (Required Accessory Off-street Loading Berths).</p>","plainText":"In all districts, as indicated, all required accessory off- street loading berths, open or enclosed, shall conform to the regulations on minimum dimensions set forth in the following table. The dimensions of off-street berths shall not include driveways or entrances to or exits from such off-street berths. Loading requirement categories (LRC) shall be as set forth in Section 36-62 (Required Accessory Off-street Loading Berths)."},{"id":"zr-17981-block-003","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp